// an `@` binding in a let-chain lowers (was: 'expected 1 bindings, got 0' from the re-parse) PROBES.md 2026-09-06d: `if let` / `while let` / let-chains lower BY DELEGATION to lower_match (temp hoist, per-arm scrutinee move, arm drops, cond-move merge); the count is a destructor tally through a raw pointer.
